# Copied to /srv/gitops/.gitignore by server/08-gitops.sh.
#
# This repository is mirrored to GitHub. Treat everything in it as published,
# even though the mirror is private - a private repo that becomes public by
# accident is a routine mistake, and a leaked credential is not recoverable
# by making it private again.
#
# Secrets belong in /srv/platform/secrets (mode 600, outside this tree) and
# are applied to the cluster by server/03-platform.sh. Manifests reference
# them with secretKeyRef and never contain a value.

# Kubernetes Secret manifests, under any name
*secret*.yaml
*secrets*.yaml
*-secret.yml

# Key material
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# Environment files, which are where credentials end up when someone is
# in a hurry
.env
.env.*
*.envrc

# Helm's own leavings
charts/*.tgz
**/charts/*.tgz
*.lock

# Render scratch space. `gitops render` writes here before moving results
# into place, so a failed render cannot leave a half-written manifest that
# Argo CD would happily apply.
.render-tmp/

# Editor noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
